regalloc (phi coalescing):
- Coalesce every if/else latch arm's copy, not just the first: the apply
  phase takes primaries (home-less) + extras (keep their Phase-2 home,
  moved onto the dest only when phi_home_blockers finds no overlapping
  foreign holder). The seen_dest dedupe stays (all-home-less = sieve +52%).
- src_use_path_clear_of_dest_redefs: a use block redefining dest is OK iff
  no src use at/after the first dest def and the terminator doesn't read src.
- source_home_survives_dest_redefs_in: dest redefs and phi-pair-web member
  defs dirty the home; a src read while dirty fails. The dirty set is
  phi_pair_web_parent (Copy edges only): the cast-inclusive web vetoed
  gzip_crc32's v40<-v17 (+5 insns, extra callee-save).
- Primaries/extras merge is set-based (was a quadratic Vec::contains).

IPA-RA (new ipa_ra.rs + wiring):
- Leaf callees publish their clobbered caller-saved GPRs; a post-pass
  relocates call-spanning slotted GPRs into provably preserved scratch
  registers (IPA_MIN_FREE_SCRATCH=1), per-call # LCCC_IPA_KEEP masks for the
  peephole, ipa_ra::verify re-checks the final asm (<= 2 rounds).
- Kill switch CCC_DISABLE_PASSES=ipa_ra; trace under CCC_DEBUG_RA.
- Measured honestly: changes 2 corpus functions (sf_inverse 30->26, no
